`\nあたりが必要かもしれない","ts":"1617323699.177500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pZgA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69c10e8c-31c7-43e1-8894-86bb396d67fb","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"Arch内のpowershell.exeが実行されようとしているってことかしら? もしくはWin側のexeをArch側で実行しようとしてmonoランタイムに繋がっちゃうのか?","ts":"1617296191.176600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/C+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97702d81-532c-4e48-a0a4-126ec3c38d21","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"【書き置き質問】\nArchWSL (WSL2) で `powershell.exe` なんかを実行しようとすると `zsh: command not found: mono` って出るんですが、理由わかる方いますか? mono が必要…?","ts":"1617293419.175500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IiR"}]}]
